<h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #dc2626; margin-top: 0;">Action Rejected</h2>

<p style="color: #334155; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
  An action requested by the agent on your task was rejected by a reviewer. Execution of this specific action was prevented.
</p>

<div class="card-box">
  <table style="width: 100%; font-size: 13px; color: #334155;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b; width: 140px;">Task:</td>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0;">Task #<%= @task&.id %> — <%= @task&.title %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b;">Tool / Action:</td>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0;"><code style="background-color: #0d0726; color: #d4f90d; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;"><%= @tool_name %></code></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b;">Reviewed By:</td>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600;"><%= @reviewer&.name || "Authorized Reviewer" %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b;">Rejection Reason:</td>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #dc2626; font-weight: 600;"><%= @reason %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b;">Decision Timestamp:</td>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-family: monospace;"><%= @reviewed_at.utc.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S UTC") %></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p style="text-align: center; margin: 28px 0;">
  <%= link_to "Inspect Task in Agent Workspace", workspace_url(task_id: @task&.id), class: "button btn-accent" %>
</p>
